my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
hello world
END_CODE

{
    desc => ': then Return (empty command) returns to normal mode',
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Macro: `xt/visual/macros/command_empty_return`

Tests that pressing `:` followed by `<Enter>` (empty command) silently
returns to normal mode with no changes.

**initial.png** — Normal mode, cursor at line 1 col 0.

Keys: `:<Enter>`

**after_empty_return.png** — Normal mode restored. Buffer content is
unchanged. The empty ex command is a no-op.
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys(':\n');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_empty_return');
    },
}
